#. L_LEE_004
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_LEE_005
msgid "Disable shield system\n"
msgstr "Desactivar sistemas de escudo\n"

#. L_LEE_006
msgid "Open hangar doors\n"
msgstr "Abrir puertas del hangar\n"

#. L_LEE_007
msgid "Access navigational systems\n"
msgstr "Acceder a los sistemas de navegación\n"

#. L_LEE_008
msgid "Sabotage engine systems\n"
msgstr "Sabotear los motores\n"

#. L_LEE_009
msgid "Gain control of bridge\n"
msgstr "Ganar el control del puente\n"

#. L_LEE_010
msgid "Ship's shields have been lowered.\n"
msgstr "Los escudos de la nave han sido bajados.\n"

#. L_LEE_011
msgid "Hangar doors have been opened.\n"
msgstr "Las puertas del hangar han sido abiertas.\n"

#. L_LEE_012
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\n"
msgstr "Elvis ha muerto.\n"

#. L_LEE_013
msgid "Navigational information has been retrieved.\n"
msgstr "La información de navegación ha sido recuperada.\n"

#. L_LEE_014
msgid "Lift has been activated.\n"
msgstr "El ascensor ha sido activado.\n"

#. L_LEE_015
msgid "All hangar Skedar have been killed.\n"
msgstr "Todos los Skedar del hangar han muerto.\n"

#. L_LEE_016
msgid ""
"Outside, Joanna. Get the shields down and \n"
"we can help you.\n"
msgstr ""
"Espera, Joanna. Baja los escudos y \n"
"te podremos ayudar.\n"

#. L_LEE_017
msgid "You've got to open the hangar doors so we can dock.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tienes que abrir las puertas del hangar \n"
"para que podamos atracar.\n"

#. L_LEE_018
msgid "Okay, we're in. I'll meet you in the hangar.\n"
msgstr "Vale, estamos dentro. Te veré en el hangar.\n"

#. L_LEE_019
msgid "Good to see you, Joanna.\n"
msgstr "Me alegro de verte, Joanna.\n"

#. L_LEE_020
msgid "Take this - you should find it useful...\n"
msgstr "Toma esto: lo encontrarás útil...\n"

#. L_LEE_021
msgid "Received AR34 assault rifle.\n"
msgstr "Rifle de asalto AR34 recibido.\n"

#. L_LEE_022
msgid ""
"Time to head upwards. I'll take this lift; \n"
"you take the other one.\n"
msgstr ""
"Es hora de avanzar. Yo tomaré este ascensor; \n"
"tú toma el otro.\n"

#. L_LEE_023
msgid "Engines have been disabled.\n"
msgstr "Los motores han sido desactivados.\n"

#. L_LEE_024
msgid "Look out, Joanna! I think we've made them angry...\n"
msgstr "¡Cuidado, Joanna! Creo que les hemos hecho enfadar...\n"

#. L_LEE_025
msgid "Bridge has been captured.\n"
msgstr "El puente ha sido capturado.\n"

#. L_LEE_026
msgid ""
"You go on ahead, Jo. I'll secure the perimeter. \n"
"We'll meet up later.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ve delante, Joanna. Aseguraré el perímetro. \n"
"Nos vemos luego.\n"

#. L_LEE_027
msgid ""
"I've got to get those shields down to let Elvis \n"
"in. I need all the help I can get.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tengo que conseguir bajar esos escudos para \n"
"meter a Elvis. Necesito toda la ayuda que pueda obtener.\n"

#. L_LEE_028
msgid "Now only the hangar bay doors are in the way.\n"
msgstr "Ahora sólo las puertas del hangar nos molestan.\n"

#. L_LEE_029
msgid "This machine contains the Skedar star maps.\n"
msgstr "Esta máquina contiene los mapas estelares Skedar.\n"

#. L_LEE_030
msgid "If we control the bridge, then the ship is ours.\n"
msgstr "Si controlamos el puente, entonces la nave será nuestra.\n"

#. L_LEE_031
msgid "Time to head upwards...\n"
msgstr "Es hora de avanzar...\n"

#. L_LEE_032
msgid "Oohhh... I'd better not be where I think I am.\n"
msgstr "Oohhh... Preferiría no estar donde creo que estoy.\n"

#. L_LEE_033
msgid ""
"And it's worse than that, my dear. Just look who you've got for company.\n"
msgstr "Y es peor que eso, querida. Sólo mira a quién tienes por compañía.\n"

#. L_LEE_034
msgid ""
"You! I thought you'd managed to escape. We found no trace of you at all.\n"
msgstr "¡Tú! Creía que habías escapado. No encontramos ningún rastro tuyo.\n"

#. L_LEE_035
msgid ""
"You couldn't find me. But there was no hiding from the Skedar, as you and "
"Mr. Carrington just discovered.\n"
msgstr ""
"No pudisteis encontrarme. Pero no me escondía de los Skedar, como tú y el "
"Sr. Carrington descubristeis.\n"

#. L_LEE_036
msgid ""
"This is it. Wait there! I'll make a distraction; it will give you a chance "
"to get out. Use it or we'll both die.\n"
msgstr ""
"Eso es. ¡Espera aquí! Crearé una distracción; te daré la oportunidad de "
"escapar. Úsala o moriremos ambas.\n"

#. L_LEE_037
msgid "Why are you doing this, Cassandra?\n"
msgstr "¿Por qué haces esto, Cassandra?\n"

#. L_LEE_038
msgid "The Skedar used me, Joanna. You are my best chance for revenge.\n"
msgstr "Los Skedar me usaron, Joanna. Tú eres mi mejor baza para vengarme.\n"

#. L_LEE_039
msgid "Eeeeaaarrrrggghhh!!!\n"
msgstr "¡¡¡Eeeeaaarrrrggghhh!!!\n"

#. L_LEE_040
msgid ""
"Wow. That's the first time I've seen another planet from space. It's "
"beautiful.\n"
msgstr ""
"Guau. Ésta es la primera vez que veo otro planeta desde el espacio. Es "
"precioso.\n"

#. L_LEE_041
msgid "Hmmmm?\n"
msgstr "¿Hmmmm?\n"

#. L_LEE_042
msgid "I don't... I don't believe it!\n"
msgstr "No... ¡No puedo creerlo!\n"

#. L_LEE_043
msgid "Elvis? What is it?\n"
msgstr "¿Elvis? ¿Qué pasa?\n"

#. L_LEE_044
msgid "Where are you going?\n"
msgstr "¿Dónde vas?\n"

#. L_LEE_045
msgid "We have to get down to the surface! Follow me!\n"
msgstr "¡Tenemos que bajar a la superficie! ¡Sígueme!\n"

#. L_LEE_046
msgid "We have to get out of here!\n"
msgstr "¡Tenemos que salir de aquí!\n"

#. L_LEE_047
msgid "Hangar doors locked - shields still active.\n"
msgstr "Puertas del hangar cerradas - escudos todavía activos.\n"

#. L_LEE_048
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Objeto crítico de la misión destruido.\n"

#. L_LEE_049
msgid "Ammo depleted - consoles can't be destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Munición agotada - las consolas no pueden ser destruidas.\n"

#. L_LEE_050
msgid "Obtain De Vries' necklace.\n"
msgstr "Obtén el collar de De Vries.\n"

#. L_LEE_051
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries:\n"

#. L_LEE_052
msgid "Necklace\n"
msgstr "Collar\n"

#. L_LEE_053
msgid "De Vries' necklace\n"
msgstr "Collar de De Vries\n"

#. L_LEE_054
msgid "Picked up De Vries' necklace.\n"
msgstr "Recogiste el collar de De Vries.\n"
